{"id":"e594c15dd6522ca0","group":"93","path":"93/93-lem-ultrafilters-product.md","title":"Ultrafilters Product","display":"Ultrafilters Product","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Algebraizable Logics","book_abbrev":"93","label":"93-lem-ultrafilters-product","aliases":["93-lem-ultrafilters-product"],"display":"Ultrafilters Product","authors":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi","book_title":"Algebraizable Logics","depends_on":["[[93-df-boolalg]]","[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","[[93-df-filter]]","[[93-df-product]]","[[93-df-ultrafilter]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"93"},{"key":"label","html":"93-lem-ultrafilters-product"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>93-lem-ultrafilters-product</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Ultrafilters Product"},{"key":"authors","html":"W. J. Blok, Don Pigozzi"},{"key":"book_title","html":"Algebraizable Logics"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7087f500cc845c3b\" href=\"?note=7087f500cc845c3b\" title=\"93-df-boolean-algebra\">93-df-boolean-algebra</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"260c377f5e1dcfdf\" href=\"?note=260c377f5e1dcfdf\" title=\"93-df-product\">93-df-product</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fc989d8f8938c283\" href=\"?note=fc989d8f8938c283\" title=\"93-df-ultrafilter\">93-df-ultrafilter</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"lem-ultrafilters-product---Ultrafilters-Product\">lem-ultrafilters-product - Ultrafilters Product</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\">\\(I\\in V\\)</span> with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(I\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf A:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf U:I\\to V\">\\(\\mathbf U:I\\to V\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A(i))\">\\(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A(i))\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U(i),\\mathbf A(i))\">\\(\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U(i),\\mathbf A(i))\\)</span> for every <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\">\\(\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}\\)</span> is the Boolean similarity type of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"757a95a2c335d9fb\" href=\"?note=757a95a2c335d9fb\" title=\"93-df-boolalg\">93-df-boolalg</a>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf P=\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\">\\(\\mathbf P=\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\\)</span> uses the common indexed-operation encoding.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\\)</span> is the Cartesian subset of the product carrier defined below.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fil}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fil}\\)</span> is the filter class of <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9beeac4373d773f8\" href=\"?note=9beeac4373d773f8\" title=\"93-df-filter\">93-df-filter</a>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ultrafilters\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\n\\coloneqq\\{a\\in|\\mathbf P|:\\forall i\\in I\\;(a(i)\\in\\mathbf U(i))\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ultrafilters\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\n\\coloneqq\\{a\\in|\\mathbf P|:\\forall i\\in I\\;(a(i)\\in\\mathbf U(i))\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\land\\mathbf U:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathbf P=\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U(i),\\mathbf A(i))\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\to\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf P^-).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\land\\mathbf U:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathbf P=\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U(i),\\mathbf A(i))\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\to\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf P^-).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>The Cartesian product of the underlying ultrafilter sets is a lattice filter of the Boolean product's lattice reduct whenever it is inhabited; it is generally not itself an ultrafilter. The explicit nonemptiness premise avoids silently assuming a choice principle for an arbitrary family.</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"lem-ultrafilters-product---Ultrafilters-Product","text":"lem-ultrafilters-product - Ultrafilters Product","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolalg]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolean-algebra","status":"resolved","id":"7087f500cc845c3b","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-boolean-algebra]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-filter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-product","status":"resolved","id":"260c377f5e1dcfdf","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-product]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-ultrafilter","status":"resolved","id":"fc989d8f8938c283","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[93-df-ultrafilter]]","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-boolalg","status":"resolved","id":"757a95a2c335d9fb","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}$ is the Boolean similarity type of [[93-df-boolalg]], and $\\mathbf P=\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})$ uses the common indexed-operation encoding.","embed":false},{"target":"93-df-filter","status":"resolved","id":"9beeac4373d773f8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Fil}$ is the filter class of [[93-df-filter]].","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"I\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"I\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf A:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf U:I\\to V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A(i))","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U(i),\\mathbf A(i))","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf P=\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fil}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}ultrafilters\\text{-}product}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\n\\coloneqq\\{a\\in|\\mathbf P|:\\forall i\\in I\\;(a(i)\\in\\mathbf U(i))\\}","display":true},{"tex":"I\\in V\\land I\\ne\\varnothing\n\\land\\mathbf A:I\\to V\\land\\mathbf U:I\\to V\n\\land\\mathbf P=\\mathrm{Prod}_{93}(\\mathbf A;I,\\tau_{\\mathsf{BA}})\n\\land\\forall i\\in I\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{BooleanAlg}_{93}(\\mathbf A(i))\n\\land\\mathrm{UltraFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U(i),\\mathbf A(i))\\bigr)\n\\land\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\\ne\\varnothing\n\\to\\mathrm{CartFil}_{93}(\\mathbf U;\\mathbf P,I)\\in\\mathrm{Fil}(\\mathbf P^-).","display":true}],"bytes":1912,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["757a95a2c335d9fb","7087f500cc845c3b","9beeac4373d773f8","260c377f5e1dcfdf","fc989d8f8938c283"]}